---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Invoice Maker: SameJob — Hailink Labs"
  description="Invoice Maker: SameJob is an iOS app in development for solo service businesses in the United States, focused on simplifying repeat invoices."
>
  <section class="page-intro product-intro">
    <a class="breadcrumb" href="/products">
      Products <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    </a>
    <p class="eyebrow">For iPhone · In development</p>
    <h1 class="product-title">
      Invoice Maker:
      <br />
      <span class="muted-heading">SameJob</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      The same customer. The same service.
      <br />
      Less work on the next invoice.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-row">
    <div class="section-label">
      <h2>Made for repeat work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body prose">
      <p>
        When you run a service business on your own, familiar jobs should feel
        familiar to invoice, too. SameJob is an iOS app focused on simplifying
        repeat invoicing for solo service businesses in the United States.
      </p>
      <p>
        We’re developing SameJob around a straightforward idea: start with a
        previous job, review what’s changed, and prepare the next invoice with
        less repeated entry.
      </p>
      <p>
        SameJob is being developed by Hailink Labs. App Store availability will
        be shared here when the app is released.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-row">
    <div class="section-label">
      <h2>Product information</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body resource-links">
      <a href="/products/samejob/support">
        <span>
          <strong>SameJob support</strong>
          <span>Questions, feedback, and product help</span>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/products/samejob/privacy">
        <span>
          <strong>Privacy policy</strong>
          <span>How SameJob handles information</span>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <p class="quiet">A product by {site.name}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
